  day: 4
  text: "\u2018Ello boss! Thanks for your help yesterday, did not actually meet Elsa
    in the mine but did meet her by the changing rooms. Had a nice chat, we talked
    about this and that. Well, I mostly did the talking but nevermind that. By the
    way, I heard they opened B3 today. I ask you please, don\u2019t send my brother
    Edvin there. The incident last year was how he lost his wife and how F11 became\u2026
    that thing. I know, send me instead!"
